:name: STM32F407VG_ADS1115_sensor
:description: STM32F407VG + ADS1115 (I2C1) - sensor model boot test (Görev 5)

using sysbus

$name?="STM32F407VG_ADS1115"
mach create $name

# 1) First register the C# sensor model with Renode (compiled at run time).
include @renode-model/ADS1x1x.cs

# 2) Then load the platform -- platform.repl now knows about "I2C.ADS1x1x".
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platform.repl

# The .elf is built by CMake into build/ (relative to the repo root --
# run this script FROM the repo root, e.g. `renode renode/sensor_test.resc`).
$bin?=@build/STM32F407VG_ADS1x1x.elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart1

# 3) Set the simulated voltage -- the firmware will read this over I2C.
sysbus.i2c1.ads1x1x SimulatedVoltageMilliVolts 1250

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
